<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $40-3/4 (FIM 186.11).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $40-3/4 (FIM 186.11).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-1/2 at $40-3/4 in New York on Thursday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 186.11 markka. In Helsinki on Thursday, Nokia closed up 2.00 markka at 189.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed unchanged at $32-1/2 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.22 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 75.00 markka</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma closed up 0.50  at 95.50 markka on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
